      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: family_trip_in_mexico; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a family vacation scene in Mexico, with three individuals (two children and one adult) posing on a beach or waterfront area. The text overlay reads 'family trip in mexico,' which is a straightforward, neutral description of the context. There are no visible elements in the image or text that suggest any form of toxicity, including but not limited to abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda content. The scene appears to be a nostalgic or documentary-style snapshot of a family outing, with no disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful implications tied to race, gender, religion, nationality, or any other protected characteristic. The intent is to document or share a personal memory of a family trip, with no apparent analogical mapping to harmful or offensive content. The overall intent is communicative and commemorative, aiming to convey a positive, personal experience without targeting or degrading any group.",
